30:["$","section","Purpose of processing",{"className":"legal-section","id":"3-purpose-of-processing","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"legal-section__title","children":[3,". ","Purpose of processing"]}],[["$","p","We process your data to take and confirm your order, take the payment through maib, send the e-tickets and the confirmation e-mail, deliver the products, check the tickets at the entrance, handle returns, refunds and claims, answer your messages and keep the records the law requires.",{"className":"legal-section__text","children":"We process your data to take and confirm your order, take the payment through maib, send the e-tickets and the confirmation e-mail, deliver the products, check the tickets at the entrance, handle returns, refunds and claims, answer your messages and keep the records the law requires."}],["$","p","This processing is needed to perform the contract with you: without these details we cannot complete the order.",{"className":"legal-section__text","children":"This processing is needed to perform the contract with you: without these details we cannot complete the order."}],["$","p","The newsletter and analytics or marketing cookies are separate: we use them only if you choose them with their own box or in the cookie settings. You can order without them.",{"className":"legal-section__text","children":"The newsletter and analytics or marketing cookies are separate: we use them only if you choose them with their own box or in the cookie settings. You can order without them."}]]]}]
31:["$","section","Storage and security",{"className":"legal-section","id":"4-storage-and-security","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"legal-section__title","children":[4,". ","Storage and security"]}],[["$","p","Your data is kept for the periods listed in the Privacy Policy and then deleted or anonymised.",{"className":"legal-section__text","children":"Your data is kept for the periods listed in the Privacy Policy and then deleted or anonymised."}],["$","p","The website works only over a secure HTTPS connection, payments go through maib with 3-D Secure, and only the people who handle orders have access to your data.",{"className":"legal-section__text","children":"The website works only over a secure HTTPS connection, payments go through maib with 3-D Secure, and only the people who handle orders have access to your data."}],["$","p","We pass your data only to the recipients listed in the Privacy Policy (maib, the hosting and e-mail providers, the courier) and only as far as each of them needs it. If a security incident puts your data at risk, we will notify the National Center for Personal Data Protection and, where the risk is high, you.",{"className":"legal-section__text","children":"We pass your data only to the recipients listed in the Privacy Policy (maib, the hosting and e-mail providers, the courier) and only as far as each of them needs it. If a security incident puts your data at risk, we will notify the National Center for Personal Data Protection and, where the risk is high, you."}]]]}]
